i use error_log() for that and just tail apache's error log.<p>for dumping arrays and things, i use an error_log_r() which just does print_r to the error log:<p><pre><code>     function error_log_r($obj) {
         ob_start();
         print_r($obj);
         $lines = explode("
", ob_get_clean());

         foreach ($lines as $line)
             error_log($line);
     }</code></pre>
